  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nDocument's [create and initialize](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-lifecycle.html#initialise-the-document-object) references `has cross-origin redirects`, which was removed from Fetch for a more specific redirect taint enum in https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1807",
